OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the north with rain
OL,6,Fclearing to brighter spells and a few
OL,7,Fshowers. Central areas start dry but
OL,8,Fturn cloudier with patchy rain later.
OL,9,FSouthern areas remain fine and dry.
OL,10,FBreezy for many with strong winds
OL,11,Ffurther north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOften cloudy with clearer
OL,14,Fspells in eastern areas. Rain and
OL,15,Fdrizzle spread east later, mainly
OL,16,Faffecting northern and western
OL,17,Fregions. Turning windier in the west.
OL,18,FMilder in the south overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
