OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAny showers in the south will
OL,6,Ffade. A few showers develop in the
OL,7,Fnorth, one or two can be heavy.
OL,8,FModerate winds in the afternoon but
OL,9,Feasing later. Feeling fresher.
